{
    "title": "BeLTOON",
    "description": "BeLTOON is a manga app for women that you can easily enjoy, from popular works to original works, anytime and anywhere. If you're looking for a manga that you can totally get addicted to, we recommend BeLTOON, which is updated daily with works from a wide range of genres!\r\n\r\n[Features of BeLTOON]\r\n\u25b6 Plenty of original works and exclusive distribution works only available on BeLTOON!\r\nEnjoy BeLTOON's exclusive works that are updated daily! You can read your favorite works faster than anyone else.\r\n\r\n\u25b6 Read popular manga every day with \u201cRental Tickets\u201d, \u201c\u00a50 Tickets\u201d, and \u201cRoulette\u201d!\r\nYou can continue reading various works with rental tickets and \u00a50 tickets that you receive every day! You can also purchase your favorite pieces using the points you earn from roulette.\r\n\r\n\u25b6 Easy-to-read app optimized for smartphones!\r\nPush notifications for those who are interested in updated information on their favorite works and \u00a50 tickets! We will deliver the information you are interested in as soon as possible! You can also use the 'bookshelf' function that allows you to manage purchased works, read works, and favorite works all at once.\r\n\r\n\u25b6Enjoy vertical reading and full-color manga! (Some works are horizontal reading and monochrome.)\r\n\r\n\r\n[BeLTOON is recommended for these people! ]\r\n\r\n\u2022 People who want to read works in a wide range of genres, from romantic comedies and romance to maniac genres.\r\n\u2022 Those who want to read many works for free\r\n\u2022 People who are looking for manga that they can't read anywhere else and are completely addicted to.\r\n\u2022 Those who want to read manga for women\r\n\u2022 Those who are interested not only in Japanese authors but also in foreign works.\r\n\r\n\u30fbOfficial Twitter https://twitter.com/beltoon_jp\r\n\u30fbOfficial Instagram https://www.instagram.com/beltoon.jp/\r\n\u30fbOfficial Youtube https://www.youtube.com/@xbeltoon7425\r\n\u30fbOfficial Tiktok https://www.tiktok.com/@beltoon_jp",
    "descriptionHTML": "BeLTOON is a manga app for women that you can easily enjoy, from popular works to original works, anytime and anywhere. If you&#39;re looking for a manga that you can totally get addicted to, we recommend BeLTOON, which is updated daily with works from a wide range of genres!<br><br>[Features of BeLTOON]<br>\u25b6 Plenty of original works and exclusive distribution works only available on BeLTOON!<br>Enjoy BeLTOON&#39;s exclusive works that are updated daily! You can read your favorite works faster than anyone else.<br><br>\u25b6 Read popular manga every day with \u201cRental Tickets\u201d, \u201c\u00a50 Tickets\u201d, and \u201cRoulette\u201d!<br>You can continue reading various works with rental tickets and \u00a50 tickets that you receive every day! You can also purchase your favorite pieces using the points you earn from roulette.<br><br>\u25b6 Easy-to-read app optimized for smartphones!<br>Push notifications for those who are interested in updated information on their favorite works and \u00a50 tickets! We will deliver the information you are interested in as soon as possible! You can also use the &#39;bookshelf&#39; function that allows you to manage purchased works, read works, and favorite works all at once.<br><br>\u25b6Enjoy vertical reading and full-color manga! (Some works are horizontal reading and monochrome.)<br><br><br>[BeLTOON is recommended for these people! ]<br><br>\u2022 People who want to read works in a wide range of genres, from romantic comedies and romance to maniac genres.<br>\u2022 Those who want to read many works for free<br>\u2022 People who are looking for manga that they can&#39;t read anywhere else and are completely addicted to.<br>\u2022 Those who want to read manga for women<br>\u2022 Those who are interested not only in Japanese authors but also in foreign works.<br><br>\u30fbOfficial Twitter https://twitter.com/beltoon_jp<br>\u30fbOfficial Instagram https://www.instagram.com/beltoon.jp/<br>\u30fbOfficial Youtube https://www.youtube.com/@xbeltoon7425<br>\u30fbOfficial Tiktok https://www.tiktok.com/@beltoon_jp",
